        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.butlereagle.com/20231010/seven-fields-paradise-progress/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The borough’s name reflects the 550‑acre farm that once rolled with cattle and crops.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.butlereagle.com/20231010/seven-fields-paradise-progress/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A historic barn and farmhouse at Seven Fields Boulevard and Old Mars Crider Road still stand today.",
